Qwen3.8-27B on TensorFold v0.6.3 (9356df5): allow TENSORFOLD_MEMORY_RESERVE_GIB=0 (the server default is 2).
Setting it to 0 leaves nothing out of MemAvailable at startup admission, so a pinned cache pool or stream memory gate
can take all available memory without startup refusal. Applies after 0003.


diff --git tensorfold/cuda/capacity.py tensorfold/cuda/capacity.py
--- tensorfold/cuda/capacity.py
+++ tensorfold/cuda/capacity.py
@@ -167,8 +167,8 @@
